{"flurry|Also... I'd like to apologize to the reindeer. Personally.":["2297c14e",3.07],"flurry|Corporal, do you ever wonder if we're the bad guys?":["557859ed",2.33],"flurry|Does this mean we finally get dental?":["62395ef0",1.99],"flurry|It's really dark though. I've stubbed my toe like four times.":["0ca618e6",4.13],"flurry|Okay! Okay! Don't snowball me! I'll talk!":["a7229684",2.09],"flurry|Sir? Do we get overtime for Christmas Eve?":["121bd001",2.54],"flurry|Somebody's stealing our stolen sacks!":["ab17d3b0",2.35],"flurry|The King has a war camp up on Reindeer Ridge. His battle plans are in the lodge.":["0b9d58c6",4.44],"holly|Again?! How many times has he done this?":["f77a9023",3.26],"holly|And if it all goes wrong?":["da1c6f0a",1.82],"holly|Battle plans. Step one: steal Christmas. Step two: question mark. Step three: get on the Nice List.":["238744b5",7.42],"holly|Can we do that again? Like, every single day?":["213ffbb4",2.98],"holly|Candy Cane Lane. It's never been this dark. Not even in July.":["28f0428b",3.74],"holly|Careful, that one's getting suspicious!":["2f56f7a7",2.21],"holly|Dasher looks so cold. Somebody give Dasher a scarf!":["1d93bb6a",3.6],"holly|Did anyone else's ears just pop?":["8e25044f",1.97],"holly|For Christmas! And for hot cocoa!":["f9675c25",2.02],"holly|Freeze! Er, I mean, hide!":["dec05a50",1.78],"holly|Got one! Oh my gosh, we got one!":["af3c1326",2.18],"holly|Hang on, Rudolph! We're coming!":["57a936bc",1.58],"holly|He's looking right at you! Get down!":["6f3e9b36",2.14],"holly|I named my snowballs. This one's Gerald.":["d9821aa8",2.78],"holly|I'm whispering. Why am I whispering? I'm on the radio.":["241557db",3.22],"holly|If we win, I'm getting the biggest hot cocoa in the Lane. With the little marshmallows.":["252d3cb5",4.39],"holly|Is it normal that my hands are shaking? Asking for me.":["53f1d33f",3.19],"holly|It's falling! It's FALLING! We did it!":["0fdd4e19",3.1],"holly|Look at that! Candy Cane Lane, glowing again!":["dfac8b06",3.14],"holly|More of them! Why is there always more of them?":["12dbb791",2.86],"holly|Not the Lane! They have the best hot cocoa in the whole North Pole!":["bdaee0bd",4.1],"holly|One down! Hey buddy, you're okay!":["87e5bc45",2.33],"holly|Ooh, pretty! Next one!":["159b8089",2.06],"holly|Ooh, this one's heavy. I bet it's a bike!":["7eca8c7f",2.47],"holly|Phew. That was close. Nobody else noticed.":["328a88e8",3.22],"holly|Rudolph! Oh, it's Dasher. Hi Dasher!":["a32fb8bb",2.54],"holly|Rudolph's nose is still glowing. Hang on, buddy. I'm coming!":["e210d4f0",3.48],"holly|Santa! Santa! The stables! They took Rudolph! And Dasher! And... the other one!":["91004aee",6.0],"holly|Sergeant, are you crying?":["b46ed253",1.06],"holly|Sergeant, what's your favorite Christmas song?":["52053a26",2.33],"holly|Simple, he says.":["a190924f",1.25],"holly|Small elves. Mighty snowballs.":["125f7dfd",2.35],"holly|So do we sneak in quiet, or go in snowballs blazing?":["d562ada9",2.95],"holly|The armory! Ooh, can I hold the sniper? I won't touch anything. Much.":["db7852e1",4.34],"holly|There they are. Frozen solid, right out on the ice.":["769f58f0",2.93],"holly|They're flying! Rudolph, you beautiful glowing goofball!":["44cb20d4",3.5],"holly|This is my first battle and I'm so excited and also extremely terrified!":["03b60d46",4.92],"holly|This one's heavy. I bet it's a bike!":["682c925f",2.14],"holly|This whole place is made of ice. How does he heat it? Does he heat it?":["2de5007b",4.06],"holly|We get to ride in the sleigh?!":["6b8a749b",1.42],"holly|Wheee! Sorry. Professional wheee.":["883a53b5",2.57],"holly|Wheeeeee!":["731fa8d4",0.94],"holly|Why do bells confuse missiles?":["b278b768",2.26],"holly|You're like a ninja. A festive ninja!":["f1e7462d",2.78],"jingle|...It's alright. I suppose.":["89077367",1.97],"jingle|...That's actually kind of sad.":["f2ef186e",2.57],"jingle|And if they fire ice missiles, hit the Jingle Flare. Bells confuse them.":["205ae1d3",4.8],"jingle|Bit loud back there. Effective. But loud.":["04bbca7d",2.78],"jingle|Blitzen. Nobody ever remembers Blitzen.":["1bd49f0c",2.69],"jingle|Christmas Eve. Four hundred and twelve years I've worked this workshop.":["830708f5",3.58],"jingle|Clean. Nobody saw a thing.":["18b86b11",1.87],"jingle|Crouch to stay small. If a guard sees you, the question mark fills up. Don't let it fill.":["7e90cc1e",5.52],"jingle|Easy. That lake is slicker than a polished candy cane.":["4cbf52c4",3.82],"jingle|Elves! For Christmas!":["39303fa3",1.3],"jingle|Good. Keep the pressure on.":["14b64086",2.04],"jingle|Got them. Now get back to Rudolph. Quietly, if you can.":["8720d3aa",3.6],"jingle|Grab and go. Don't stop to read the tags.":["5907d5b3",2.66],"jingle|Halfway there. Keep it steady.":["e67aaf37",1.97],"jingle|He's seen you. Three seconds before he sounds the alarm!":["201da2c6",3.36],"jingle|Here comes another wave!":["75dc9f51",1.44],"jingle|I hate flying. I've always hated flying.":["a13336ac",2.76],"jingle|Ice cannons on the igloos down there. Knock them out!":["a6b00cb6",2.98],"jingle|It's a sock, Pip.":["3019af4a",0.98],"jingle|It's the wind.":["92ae011d",0.79],"jingle|Keep the Legion out of the circle or the power cuts out. Simple.":["7a40c271",3.79],"jingle|Landing in the courtyard. Everyone off.":["88918037",2.38],"jingle|Mailroom. Want to snowball your friends? Send them a party code.":["be6d3cf1",3.65],"jingle|Mind the mortars. When he shouts, move.":["e19e4a36",3.43],"jingle|Never once had a quiet one.":["0b71a042",1.68],"jingle|Not bad, rookie. You only screamed twice.":["301a574b",2.71],"jingle|Not one alarm the whole way. I'm almost proud.":["1c76ae8b",2.93],"jingle|Patience. Let them walk past.":["55599bd4",2.11],"jingle|Patrol on the ice. Keep your head down.":["de476a12",2.4],"jingle|Perfectly normal. Mine stopped shaking in 1712.":["8c69a4e5",3.62],"jingle|Shoot the glowing cannons on its sides! That's how you bring it down!":["a1a274a4",3.79],"jingle|Silence. My favorite is silence.":["0cb20a5b",2.62],"jingle|Small steps on the ice. You run, you slide. You slide, you fall. You fall, I laugh.":["2db115cc",5.57],"jingle|Station by station. Clear it, hold it, light it.":["1453baaf",3.46],"jingle|That blaster's not suppressed! Everyone heard that!":["21bb8eb8",3.02],"jingle|That's one. Keep moving.":["d4153bd1",1.8],"jingle|The Frost Legion war camp. A dozen guards, one lodge, one very important folder.":["559b7cd7",6.02],"jingle|Then it gets loud. Loud is fine too. Just messier.":["09d57860",3.34],"jingle|Then talk.":["880369dc",0.79],"jingle|Then we go get it.":["647e4815",1.46],"jingle|Thirty-one. He sends a card every year. It just says: Soon.":["ef46250d",4.06],"jingle|Watch the doorways. They love the doorways.":["67a65a06",2.81],"jingle|Well, so much for quiet. Go loud! Snowballs out!":["bc5c444c",3.36],"jingle|You heard the big man. Snowballs up!":["e9dac0c0",2.47],"jingle|You've been spotted! Drop him, quick!":["d5477a95",2.11],"jingle|Your call, rookie. Quiet keeps them guessing. Loud keeps it interesting.":["3ef7d30d",4.7],"king|...Fine. Here. And... Merry Christmas. I suppose.":["090865bc",3.46],"king|...Free it. Quietly.":["417e9d4a",1.68],"king|...Really?":["1490c330",0.86],"king|A sleigh? You brought a sleigh to an AIR battle?":["98947930",3.14],"king|By sunrise, the children of the world will wake up to... nothing! Mwa ha ha!":["076b0888",5.81],"king|Do you know how hard it is to get a decent cup of cocoa in an ice castle?!":["cc348073",4.85],"king|Do you know what I got for Christmas in 1847? Coal. One lump. For one tiny avalanche!":["94ce480b",8.66],"king|Don't call me Gary!":["ad3d079a",1.44],"king|Every sack goes on the train. Every. Last. One.":["f80fa46e",3.72],"king|Gliders! Turn them into a fruitcake!":["c5ba41c6",2.45],"king|I can SEE you, elves! I have a very large window!":["a08971ab",3.96],"king|Impossible... beaten by... elves...":["a4390584",2.5],"king|Little sleigh... meet my FLAGSHIP! Mwa-ha-ha!":["40bd1c30",3.53],"king|Silence, Private Flurry! Villainy is its own reward!":["21a799d5",3.74],"king|So. You've come for the sack.":["a620dc11",1.92],"king|Tonight the North Pole freezes! Every toy! Every elf! Every festive little sweater!":["cae0a998",6.22],"pip|Each station powers about four thousand lights. Ooh, and the big tree!":["8cae4ecf",4.1],"pip|For the record, I designed the cup holders.":["0f52068e",2.62],"pip|Fun fact: reindeer can see ultraviolet light. Not useful right now. Just fun.":["84b1b69c",4.49],"pip|Honestly? Nobody knows.":["975c0f4d",1.56],"pip|I made you something! The Hush Mitten. It goes on the end of your blaster and makes it whisper.":["29c33a89",4.94],"pip|Ice missile incoming! Hit the Jingle Flare! Space, or cross on a controller!":["c8560601",4.49],"pip|It's a tactical sock.":["445dceae",1.44],"pip|Pip from Toy Research here. If you break the conveyor belt, please don't. It took me ages.":["ad625643",5.38],"pip|Power's back on that block. Two more grids to go!":["6025c722",3.0],"pip|Pro tip: the Frost Legion hates snow down the collar. That's not really tactical. It's just true.":["50893ddd",5.47],"pip|Settings! And cocoa. Mostly cocoa. The settings are in the cocoa. Not literally.":["7c7086e4",5.18],"pip|Sneak up behind one and melee to take him out quietly. The Hush Mitten keeps your shots whisper-quiet too!":["b1de0910",6.43],"pip|The Polar Express runs on cocoa steam. Technically you could drink the exhaust. Please don't.":["bda68131",6.05],"pip|The candy cannon is on the back. It overheats, so give it a breather now and then.":["b71ac52f",4.27],"pip|The candy cannon overheats, so let it breathe between bursts!":["fb8ccaa4",4.15],"pip|The guards change shifts every... I don't actually know. I made that up to sound cool.":["b82c7592",4.56],"pip|Uh, guys? Bad news! The Legion is loading the gift sacks onto the Polar Express!":["d06de4df",5.33],"pip|Um, hi! Pip here, from Toy Research. I've never been on a real mission radio before. This is so cool.":["0fb3e1a1",6.26],"pip|Um, lots of them are coming. Like, a LOT.":["8a7f225e",2.81],"santa|...Then we're going to get him back.":["e9f0765f",1.97],"santa|...and to all a good night!":["63d58ef0",1.82],"santa|After Christmas, little one. First, we have a king to visit.":["d91c1724",4.01],"santa|Elves! Positions! Nobody touches the toy line!":["81e989b9",3.74],"santa|Elves, gather round. I won't sugar-coat it. Well, maybe a little. It is Christmas.":["00c40a6b",5.35],"santa|Four... five! Every sack accounted for. Well, nearly.":["c6ec8006",3.89],"santa|Gary, you buried a village.":["7031022e",1.97],"santa|Gary. Nobody is ever too far gone for the Nice List.":["88991583",3.55],"santa|Good work. And look at this page. He's powering his Citadel with the stolen lights of Candy Cane Lane.":["40d4b774",6.72],"santa|Ho ho HO! Did you see that zeppelin go down?":["214727c8",3.48],"santa|Ho ho HO! Did you see that?!":["cac610c6",2.3],"santa|Ho ho ho! Everyone gets dental!":["be15cf59",2.78],"santa|Ho ho ho! Look at them run! Back to the ice with you!":["d1eafe18",3.84],"santa|Ho ho ho! Merry Christmas to all...":["25ebcf45",2.74],"santa|Ho ho ho! Merry Christmas!":["c7d1a3a0",2.42],"santa|Ho ho! The map table. Pick a mission, any mission. Well, start with the first one.":["e559a353",5.59],"santa|Ho ho, nice throw! Very nice!":["7793a954",2.59],"santa|Hold on to your hats! Dasher, Dancer, full speed ahead!":["53084c27",3.89],"santa|Hold the workshop. Not one present leaves this building in a Frost Legion sack.":["bd63a395",5.52],"santa|It's in the Igloo Citadel, and he's filled the sky with ice gliders. We'll have to fly.":["3a572409",5.74],"santa|My own sack is missing. The big one. Every wish of every child is in that sack.":["3ecc4ddd",5.45],"santa|Not on my watch. Five sacks. Grab them all.":["a16c65e1",3.22],"santa|Off you go! Mind the snowballs.":["5dabdb87",2.5],"santa|Prancer, eyes on the sky, not on the cocoa!":["1122f7c5",3.41],"santa|Rudolph?!":["c4f11ea6",0.89],"santa|She's taking a beating! Keep those gliders off us!":["82678ecc",3.46],"santa|Stand next to each one and crack the ice. It takes a few seconds.":["d9ced6ad",4.37],"santa|Start by giving back the sack.":["5109011d",1.97],"santa|Stay out of their sight and they'll never know you were there. Get the plans, then get out.":["96933bda",5.18],"santa|Steady, elves. Steady.":["4674fab9",1.94],"santa|That's all five! Bring them to the sleigh!":["332b9e8c",2.71],"santa|The Frost King has declared war on Christmas. Again.":["5dc95d5b",3.98],"santa|Then bring them to my sleigh at the south end of the yard.":["38cfca48",3.62],"santa|This ends tonight. Up the stairs, onto the roof.":["cca1df36",3.34],"santa|Those sacks hold the presents for an entire continent. Treat them gently!":["ce4eb31d",4.85],"santa|Three light stations. Take each one back and hold it.":["f1500b0d",3.48],"santa|Up the stairs, onto the roof. I'll be right behind you!":["e0b9dfc4",3.82],"santa|Welcome to the workshop! Have a look around. Walk up to any station to get started.":["2fbbc504",5.5],"sleet|Corporal Sleet reporting. The lights are secure, Your Majesty.":["b3a0a3a9",4.15],"sleet|Every day, Flurry. Every single day.":["edff91ab",3.31],"sleet|Hold the stations! The King said no overtime pay if we lose!":["4b59af3d",5.4],"sleet|Sir, your cape is caught in the train door.":["00aceb31",2.57],"jingle|Patrols on the ice. Stay low, stay quiet... and they'll never know you were here.":["7a84c974",4.87],"holly|And if they do spot you? Make some noise. We'll come running!":["8fe18938",3.29],"holly|That's the alarm! Hang on, we're coming in!":["67d9dd84",2.33],"cmd|Team Snowball. First squad to forty freezes wins. Move out!":["71ee3277",3.38],"cmd|Gift Grab. Freeze them, grab their gifts. Go!":["62fc8d1d",3.02],"cmd|First frost!":["f9236c03",1.3],"cmd|Double kill!":["b34a1c20",0.67],"cmd|Triple kill!":["1c5abfa3",0.96],"cmd|Snowstorm!":["fc5a0ff7",0.74],"cmd|Reindeer Recon is up.":["d59c03aa",1.34],"cmd|Snowman sentry deployed.":["a67bd59a",1.61],"cmd|Sleigh strike inbound!":["af1c1b82",1.44],"cmd|Frosty drone away.":["4faeb883",1.46],"cmd|Blizzard incoming!":["cf4abf7d",1.25],"cmd|Peppermint mortars, inbound!":["15a99e1c",1.63],"cmd|Enemy blizzard! Brace yourselves!":["a08142de",2.16],"cmd|Killstreak ready.":["b13aad67",1.08],"cmd|One minute remaining.":["15ec5282",1.06],"cmd|We've taken the lead.":["329b0888",1.08],"cmd|We've lost the lead.":["1eea2649",1.34],"cmd|Five more and we win it!":["a7ad84f4",1.68],"cmd|They're five away. Dig in!":["acc449e6",1.85],"cmd|Victory!":["309d5211",0.5],"cmd|Defeat.":["e464f455",0.62],"cmd|Draw.":["138b4cfc",0.55],"cmd|Final killcam.":["97d272f3",1.42],"santa|Elves! Wake up! Everybody up! They're at the gates!":["75ebea4a",3.41],"jingle|Rookie. You're with me. Armory first. Grab a blaster.":["ad8736fd",3.31],"holly|Is this a drill? Please tell me this is a drill.":["a7c5e10a",2.78],"jingle|They're coming over the north wall. On me. Push them back!":["6996ee71",4.1],"holly|Okay. Okay. Snowballs. I can do snowballs.":["371dbc50",3.62],"jingle|Courtyard's clear. Don't celebrate. That was the welcome party.":["e837b96f",3.89],"santa|Hold the factory! Nobody touches the toy line!":["d9e99419",3.46],"pip|Pip from Toy Research. If you break the conveyor belt, please don't. It took me ages.":["1b4b0869",5.71],"jingle|Second wave! Find cover!":["32412624",1.97],"holly|There's so many of them!":["7deac58f",1.97],"holly|The stables! Somebody's in the stables!":["2334e46d",2.28],"santa|My reindeer! Go, go, go!":["34c5e190",2.5],"sleet|Fall back! Fall back! We've got what we came for!":["e2a55ba7",4.3],"holly|Rudolph? Dasher? Here, boys...":["ee51a0be",2.26],"holly|They're gone. Rudolph, Dasher, Blitzen... all of them!":["4927f729",3.02],"pip|Wait! I put tracking collars on the reindeer! Get to my lab, I can find them!":["c2dee796",4.3],"jingle|South-east cottage. Move fast, they're regrouping.":["88d3d1f2",3.48],"pip|Booting up. This takes about a minute. Maybe two. Please don't let me get snowballed.":["c103a2ea",4.66],"jingle|Nobody gets near the lab. Nobody.":["e5dc3090",2.4],"pip|Almost there! Ninety percent! Ninety one!":["75973187",3.65],"pip|Got them! All three collars! The Frozen Lake. They're dragging them onto the ice!":["1e597ce2",5.42],"santa|Those cannons are pounding my roof! Knock them out before they hit the sleigh!":["c76ff870",4.94],"jingle|Three cannons, north field. Flank them. Don't charge them.":["cfe66a0c",3.79],"santa|The sleigh! Somebody check the sleigh!":["1df6cd1a",2.52],"king|Thank you for the warm welcome, Santa. I'll be taking your sack. And your reindeer. Merry Christmas.":["dce348bc",6.65],"santa|My sack! He took the whole sack!":["c29a0c36",2.38],"pip|Crouch to stay small. Melee from behind is silent. So is the Hush Mitten.":["e82fb349",4.44],"jingle|Three lookouts with radios. Take them down quietly, or the whole Legion comes running.":["f6162baa",5.04],"jingle|Radios are dark. Nice and quiet.":["ae9c3937",3.1],"flurry|Hey! Who's there? Intruders on the ice! Intruders!":["1dab1eab",4.18],"jingle|Form up on the reindeer. Nobody gets through.":["b8e4de69",2.59],"pip|The ice is cracking. That's either very good or very bad.":["ff7d3300",3.55],"jingle|Rudolph's past those huts. Clear them out. Room by room.":["cc6335aa",4.25],"holly|Rudolph! I can see his nose glowing through the ice!":["919e8209",2.9],"santa|That's my boy! Ho ho ho!":["f7cb90fc",2.28],"jingle|Runner! One of them's running for the lodge!":["b4b3906e",2.23],"flurry|Okay! Okay! I surrender! Don't snowball me!":["16c31da5",3.14],"jingle|Talk.":["d9190641",0.72],"flurry|The battle plans. The King keeps them at the war camp on Reindeer Ridge. Everything's in them.":["d22eca1e",5.52],"flurry|If the King finds out I talked, I'm getting reassigned to the ice mines.":["0875c5e2",3.74],"holly|You can sit next to me in the sled. I have snacks.":["4cc24a63",2.98],"jingle|Prisoner secured. Reindeer secured. Next stop, Reindeer Ridge.":["db0805ef",4.63],"pip|Jingle-bell charges. Very loud. Very festive. I'll set them off once you're clear.":["76c49367",4.7],"sleet|Every day, Flurry. Every single day. Wait. Flurry?":["970642bb",4.92],"sleet|Hey! Those are the King's doodles! Get that elf!":["01e06761",3.89],"jingle|So much for quiet. We're coming to you. Hold tight!":["0981e612",3.02],"pip|Charges armed. I need fifty seconds for the bells to sync. Don't ask.":["8db18e88",4.54],"pip|Three, two, one... ho ho BOOM!":["d1d81b3b",2.76],"holly|Run! Rudolph's warming up the sled!":["c15ab3cc",2.66],"jingle|Plans are in the sled. Let's see what the King's been doodling.":["e763603f",3.77],"santa|Those are my elves in there! Get them out of the ice!":["4175e436",3.48],"holly|You're okay! You're okay! Go, run!":["ea05c4e0",2.52],"pip|Mrs. Peppermint! She makes the best fudge!":["95316526",3.07],"holly|That's everyone on this street!":["d4ba3903",2.02],"jingle|Snipers. Three of them. Watch for the glint and stay out of the open.":["b398efef",3.77],"pip|Power's back on that block. One more grid to go!":["94b4fdf9",3.34],"holly|Is that a tank? That's a tank. Why do they have a tank?":["84dec24c",3.43],"jingle|Grenades and heavy snow. Hit it from the sides.":["bc1567e0",3.17],"jingle|Armor down. Push to the last station.":["af28758a",2.42],"sleet|Everybody to station C! It's our last one!":["5d750a7b",3.24],"pip|Rerouting all three stations to the tree. This is the big one. Sixty seconds!":["37348382",5.47],"sleet|Not the tree! Anything but the tree!":["3afd2f2b",3.02],"santa|Look at that! The whole Lane is shining! Ho ho ho!":["157850b5",3.55],"pip|The flight path is back. And the plans say the King is loading the sacks onto the Polar Express.":["ea4b2444",4.7],"jingle|Quiet entry. Nobody knows we're here yet. Let's keep it that way.":["82825597",3.84],"pip|Red wire, blue wire. It's always the red wire. Probably.":["15398dd2",3.58],"pip|Alarm's dead. They can scream all they want now.":["fdfca898",2.81],"santa|Ho ho! Hand them up! Quickly now, quickly!":["30f3cb7d",3.22],"sleet|Somebody's stealing our stolen sacks!":["784c6517",2.42],"jingle|The train's still loading. Take the platform.":["e9701ee1",2.69],"pip|Hit the boiler on the engine. Hard.":["0f00ae41",2.16],"pip|Boiler's cracked! That train isn't going anywhere.":["ecc4e853",3.24],"santa|I'll walk, thank you! My knees could use the stretch.":["232fddf1",3.22],"jingle|Keep him covered. All sides.":["5cba379d",1.82],"santa|Every sack is home. Except the big one. My sack. He's taken it to his Citadel.":["aba4c97e",5.42],"santa|Hold on to your hat! And the cannon! Mostly the cannon!":["935e50a5",3.79],"santa|She's hit! We're going down! Hold on!":["d0d25480",2.69],"holly|Everybody okay? Rudolph's okay! The sleigh is... less okay.":["a0767991",4.08],"santa|I need a minute to fix the runners. Keep them off me!":["bfdea0c5",3.38],"jingle|Mortar nests, north and south. They'll flatten the sleigh. Go!":["25e7de4b",3.84],"santa|Runners fixed! You go ahead. I'll meet you on the roof!":["28ca17b9",3.6],"jingle|We're at the wall. Here's where it gets serious.":["e7496f0c",2.38],"pip|Gate's open! Well. Gate's gone.":["1a5f6a45",2.26],"holly|Tinsel! You're okay!":["50b989b8",1.44],"pip|Sprocket from Engineering! Grab a snowball, we need you!":["83045ef1",3.72],"holly|That's all of them!":["dec1a9ec",0.94],"pip|Those generators shield the roof. Knock out all three and the King's wide open.":["651cc179",4.37],"king|My generators! Do you know what those cost?!":["8c8c9fbc",3.0],"king|Guards! GUARDS! Somebody get up here!":["d32a7b1a",2.71],"santa|My sack! Oh, I've missed you, old friend.":["b9b52b78",3.0],"jingle|Sun's coming up. Move it, rookie!":["bc81378f",1.61],"holly|Prancer! They took Prancer too! The kennels, north-west!":["811b0286",3.89],"jingle|Good. Now the creek. Stay off the open snow.":["60a5815b",3.1],"pip|See the one with the big brass whistle? That whistle keeps the reindeer frozen. Take it.":["58608c22",4.73],"holly|Got the whistle! It's... really sticky. Ew.":["63fe0e53",3.14],"jingle|They know we're here now. Dig in around Rudolph.":["8c7c2436",3.17],"holly|Hang in there, Rudolph! Almost warm!":["4f4d4886",2.3],"sleet|You... helped me? Nobody in the Legion ever helped me.":["8d3f8e40",4.15],"jingle|Cold. But smart. Keep that badge.":["9327597e",2.98],"king|A badge thief AND a sleigh guard? You're wasted on Santa, elf.":["39176e56",4.32],"king|Whoever is wearing Flurry's radio... I've been watching you, elf. You're good. Perhaps too good for Santa.":["c1c595de",6.6],"jingle|Ignore him. We've got what we need. Reindeer Ridge.":["583cfc86",3.5],"pip|Okay. No countdown then. Ho ho BOOM!":["1856785c",3.12],"holly|Were there... people in those tents?":["4017bc6b",2.45],"king|Candy Cane Lane. Lovely place. You and I are not so different, elf.":["ac17382e",4.9],"flurry|Brr! Thanks! We're with you, elves. The King left us to freeze!":["614ebe59",3.94],"holly|We're really just going to leave them there?":["52f1a8ba",1.78],"king|Hmph. Your loss, elf.":["27a8943e",2.59],"king|Excellent. I knew you'd see reason.":["f687a5bf",2.4],"santa|Ho ho! Hand them up! Hmm. I could have sworn there were more sacks...":["678e61f4",4.2],"jingle|Frostpeak. Big mountain, bad weather, worse company.":["dbc903b7",3.29],"holly|I can't feel my ears. Do elves need ears? Asking for me.":["dadde4a9",4.37],"jingle|Outpost's clear. Keep moving north.":["ceac49cc",2.57],"jingle|That's a nine meter wall of ice. Pip, tell me you packed the ice picks.":["1be8f14b",4.25],"pip|Packed them, polished them, named them. Gerald and Gerald Two.":["d6784dab",3.12],"holly|You did it! Okay, now pull us up. Please. It's very slippery down here.":["6540b275",4.8],"pip|Whiteout up there. They can barely see their own mittens. Neither can you, so stay close to the beacons.":["76c6f9fd",5.78],"jingle|Three terminals. Quiet is good. Loud is fine. Dead is not.":["b07fe500",4.46],"pip|One down. The radar's getting confused. Like me in the morning.":["d925fd44",3.12],"pip|Two! I can see the Engine's control codes now.":["c5b03886",2.59],"pip|Three! Their radar is blind. The Engine's door code is... one, two, three, four. Seriously?":["e9a8dcfb",6.12],"king|Who let an ELF into my weather machine?!":["afdeb832",3.02],"pip|Good call. Gentle and festive.":["b8c90588",2.74],"jingle|That's a lot of snow coming down on a lot of soldiers.":["5cd50a3c",2.78],"pip|Core is down! Uh oh. Did anyone else feel the mountain wobble?":["cd9025b1",4.06],"pip|Overload in sixty seconds! We need to be very not here!":["475e9a37",3.84],"jingle|The whole mountain is coming down! Zipline, east side of the cliff! Go!":["2a12f6e1",4.66],"santa|Ho ho! I can see you! RUN!":["8a9ffaef",2.38],"santa|Hold on tight! Up we go!":["18e2a605",2.04],"holly|We're alive! We're alive and I'm never going skiing.":["c04ac6fa",4.22],"santa|Ho ho! That's the spirit.":["dab801fc",2.11],"holly|He's waving at us... Okay. He's not waving anymore. He's sulking.":["30b7a7a9",3.94],"king|So. You came after all. Welcome to the winning side, General.":["4133db15",4.42],"king|Santa is coming. Hold my gate, and Christmas is ours.":["1f0a3b2e",4.15],"holly|Is that... is that you up there?":["08980bef",2.57],"holly|Why are you doing this?! You were one of us!":["478ca474",2.5],"jingle|Rookie. Put it down. It's not too late.":["734f72ae",2.5],"holly|Just... think about what you're doing. Please.":["bf25da95",2.98],"santa|I'm not angry. I'm just very, very disappointed. Ho... ho.":["8d2f3052",4.51],"santa|Elves! To me!":["54dc3ef2",1.39],"king|What are you doing? No. NO! Traitor!":["a3de8062",2.59],"santa|Ho ho! I knew it. Run, my friend!":["154a1e38",2.74],"king|Christmas is cancelled! Everyone gets a snow day instead! Ha ha ha!":["7ab9c5fb",5.14],"holly|This is the worst Christmas ever.":["242425de",2.06]}